  "description": "Deterministic async assertion helpers for Microsoft Orleans test suites.\n      Monitors grain calls and storage operations, then retries assertions until\n      they pass or a configurable timeout is reached.",
  "id": "Egil.Orleans.Testing",
  "isPrerelease": false,
