  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "New Features:\n- add live operation feeds to GrainActivityCollector\n  Add SubscribeToStorageOperations and SubscribeToGrainCalls methods that\n  return IAsyncEnumerable<T> for lossless, future-only event collection.\n  Each feed uses unbounded channels so slow consumers never lose events,\n  while the existing bounded wait-subscriber path stays unchanged.\n  Both global and grain-scoped overloads are provided. Subscription starts\n  on first MoveNextAsync and ends on cancellation or break.",
